# Codebuff's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-codebuff-setting-api-key = 来自 https://www.codebuff.com 的 Codebuff API 密钥。仅用于读取点数余额；未提供时，使用 `codebuff login` 的会话，还可读取套餐和每周限额。
usage-codebuff-setting-base-url = 替代 https://www.codebuff.com 的 https URL，例如预发布服务器。不使用其他协议，以确保令牌始终加密传输。

## The report: the account's credits, weekly limit, and billing settings.
## Plan names and the subscription's status (such as Active) stay as
## Codebuff sends them.

# The limit: how much of the credit quota is spent.
usage-codebuff-credits = 点数
# The balance: credits left.
usage-codebuff-remaining = 剩余
usage-codebuff-account = 账号
usage-codebuff-subscription = 订阅
# Whether credits are bought automatically when they run low.
usage-codebuff-auto-top-up = 自动充值
usage-codebuff-on = 开启
usage-codebuff-off = 关闭
